{
  "name": "ReviewPilot Tool - SonarQube Quality Gate Status",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ReviewPilot Tool - SonarQube Quality Gate Status (Fase 7)\n- **Finalidade:** subworkflow opcional somente leitura exposto ao `Review Agent` via `Call n8n Workflow Tool` (`sonarqube_quality_gate_tool`).\n- **Servidor MCP:** `http://sonarqube-mcp:8080/mcp` na rede interna `reviewpilot-net` via `HTTP Streamable` (`httpStreamable`).\n- **Ferramenta MCP:** `get_project_quality_gate_status`.\n- **Resiliência (SonarQube Opcional):** retorna `UNAVAILABLE_OPTIONAL` quando o SonarQube estiver desligado ou inacessível.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 660
      },
      "id": "d7000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "SonarQube Tool Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "workflowInputs",
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "projectKey",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d7000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When Executed by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
